My Recommendation

Implement these enhancements:

✅ One-time folder configuration

✅ Settings saved locally (user_settings.json)

✅ User can change path from Settings menu

✅ Auto-create folders by Submission Type

✅ Auto-create daily folder (10-Sep-2026)

✅ Auto-create operator folder (Raja Amuthan)

✅ Timestamp-based filenames

✅ No "Choose Location" popup for every PDF

This will make the application much more user-friendly and eliminate repetitive save-location selection while maintaining a clean audit-ready folder structure.
